    "title": "Ex-Titans scout Blaise Taylor found guilty in girlfriend's death - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gesi Lloyd ,\n8 hours ago A Nashville jury has found former Tennessee Titans scout Blaise Taylor guilty of murdering his girlfriend, Jade Benning, and her unborn child, closing out a nine day trial that included emotional testimony and dueling accounts of how Benning died. Taylor, 30, was convicted on four counts, including second degree murder... Read full article",
